safix::cards_ambiguous

  × more than one card is connected, so there is nothing to enroll
  │ unambiguously.
  │ 
  │ Connected:
  │   - 11111111
  │   - 22222222
  │ 
  │ Name the one you mean:
  │ 
  │     safix enroll --serial <serial> [<user>]
  │ 
  │ Guessing is the one guess with a provisioning at the end of it: the card
  │ that was not meant would have its PIN, PUK and management key replaced.
